# GMS splits this in two: a permanent 20 points of status resistance and a
# buff that builds to another 100 while the Ranger keeps attacking. A Ranger
# who is attacking is every Ranger, so the two are one figure here -- which is
# where the 6 a level comes from.
#
# Nothing in this game inflicts a status or an element, so neither figure is
# read anywhere. Both are on the stats page so the SP is not spent blind.
name: "Focused Fury"
skill_order: 6
description: "Increases resistance to abnormal status and to elemental damage."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_RANGER
max_level: 20
base { status_resistance: 6 elemental_resistance: 0.01 }
per_level { status_resistance: 6 elemental_resistance: 0.01 }
